<p><strong>Safety and Security</strong></p>
<table class="table" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td colspan="8"><strong>Passenger Restraint Systems</strong></td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Nissan Advanced Air Bag System</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">Driver and front passenger air bags with dual-<br />stage inflation, seat belt sensors and occupant classification sensor</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Driver and front passenger seat-mounted side-impact supplemental air bags</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Roof-mounted curtain side-impact supplemental air bags</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Outboard seat belts, front</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">3-point (ALR/ELR for pass., ELR for driver)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Seatbelts with pre-tensioners and load limiters</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Top tether anchor (passenger seat)</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<table class="table" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td colspan="8"><strong>Safety and Security Features</strong></td>
<td width="129" colspan="12" align="center">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Zone Body Construction with front and rear crumple zones<br />Energy-absorbing steering column Slide away brake pedal<br />Break away rear engine mount<br />Hood buckling creases and safety stops Body side reinforcements<br />Aluminum side-door guard beams Power window lockout button Vehicle Dynamic Control<br />Traction Control System<br />Tire Pressure Monitoring System Nissan Vehicle Immobilizer System<br />Vehicle Security System</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Automatic Emergency Braking with Pedestrian Detection</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Intelligent Forward Collision Warning</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Blind Spot Warning</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Lane Departure Warning</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="8">Rear Cross Traffic Alert</td>
<td colspan="12" align="center">S</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>Dimensions</strong></p>
<table class="table" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
