<td colspan="3" align="center"><strong>Performance</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="10">Proto Spec: Yellow-colored brake calipers, bronze-colored aluminum-alloy wheels, exclusive shift lever knob (MT only), exclusive Proto Spec leather-appointed seats with yellow accents, exclusive Proto Spec suede + cloth door trim with yellow stitching, special Proto<br />Spec interior stitching</td>
<td colspan="8" align="center">-</td>
